<section id="features" style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 64px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px">
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items: center; text-align: center">
    <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.025em">Review, stage and commit.<br>Without leaving the diff.</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; color: var(--fg-2); max-width: 34rem">Everything a review needs, a keystroke away.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px">

    <article class="shell" style="flex: 2 1 560px; min-width: 0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
      <div class="inset" style="height: 200px; border-radius: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 16px; box-sizing: border-box">
        <div class="shell" style="width: min(100%, 460px); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 30px">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 12px; background: var(--del-bg)"><span>− let n = <span style="background: var(--del-word); border-radius: 3px">10_000</span>;</span><kbd style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-2)">x discard</kbd></div>
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 12px; background: var(--add-bg)"><span>+ let n = <span style="background: var(--add-word); border-radius: 3px">2_000</span>;</span><kbd style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--add-fg)">a stage</kbd></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 18px 16px 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
        <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500">Stage a hunk, a line or a word</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg-3)">Pick exactly what goes into the commit, down to a single word change. Discard the rest, then commit with ⌘↩. ⌘Z undoes the last commit.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="shell" style="flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
      <div class="inset" style="height: 200px; border-radius: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px">
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center">
          <kbd class="key" style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 16px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 13px">j</kbd>
          <kbd class="key" style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 16px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 13px">k</kbd>
          <kbd class="key" style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 16px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 13px">a</kbd>
          <kbd class="key" style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 16px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 13px">⌘↩</kbd>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-3)">next - previous - stage - commit</span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 18px 16px 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
        <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500">Made for the keyboard</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg-3)">Every command has a key and a menu item. ⇧⌘P finds any of them by name; ? lists them all.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="shell" style="flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
      <div class="inset" style="height: 200px; border-radius: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; padding: 16px; box-sizing: border-box">
        <div class="shell" style="width: min(100%, 240px); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 28px">
          <div style="padding: 0 10px; background: var(--move-bg); color: var(--move-fg)">⇡ fn settle(group)</div>
          <div style="padding: 0 10px; color: var(--fg-5)">  …</div>
          <div style="padding: 0 10px; background: var(--move-bg); color: var(--move-fg)">⇣ fn settle(group)</div>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-3)">press m to jump to the other end</span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 18px 16px 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
        <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500">Moves shown as moves</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg-3)">Code that moved gets its own colour instead of reading as a removal and an addition.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="shell" style="flex: 2 1 560px; min-width: 0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
      <div class="inset" style="height: 200px; border-radius: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 16px; box-sizing: border-box">
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; width: min(100%, 480px); font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 26px">
          <div class="shell" style="flex: 1; min-width: 0; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden"><div style="padding: 0 10px; font-family: Geist, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-3); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">Ours <kbd style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace">1</kbd></div><div style="padding: 0 10px; background: var(--add-bg)">timeout = 30</div></div>
          <div class="shell" style="flex: 1; min-width: 0; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden"><div style="padding: 0 10px; font-family: Geist, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-3); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">Theirs <kbd style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace">2</kbd></div><div style="padding: 0 10px; background: var(--move-bg)">timeout = 45</div></div>
          <div class="shell" style="flex: 1; min-width: 0; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden"><div style="padding: 0 10px; font-family: Geist, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-3); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">Both <kbd style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace">3</kbd></div><div style="padding: 0 10px">timeout = 45</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 18px 16px 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
        <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500">A merge editor for git mergetool</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg-3)">Step through conflicts with n and p, and take ours, theirs or both with 1, 2 and 3. Collate can be your difftool too.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px">
    <div class="shell" style="border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M12 4v16"></path></svg>
      <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500">Split or unified</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--fg-3)">Switch with s. Wrap long lines with w, hide whitespace with W.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shell" style="border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"></path></svg>
      <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500">Search with regex</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--fg-3)">⌘F searches the diff, the map and history, by case, whole word or pattern.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shell" style="border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21c1.5-4 4.5-6 8-6s6.5 2 8 6"></path></svg>
      <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500">Inline blame</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--fg-3)">Press b to see who last changed each line, beside the line numbers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shell" style="border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="m7 10 3 2-3 2"></path><path d="M13 15h4"></path></svg>
      <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500">A terminal built in</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--fg-3)">⌘J opens a terminal drawer under the diff, in the repository you're reviewing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
